>Grimes</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>RNA-dependent RNA polymerases of dsRNA bacteriophages</article-title><source>Virus Res.</source><year>2004</year><volume>101</volume><fpage>45</fpage><lpage>55</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15010216</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B9"><label>9</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Makeyev</surname><given-names>EV</given-names></name><name><surname>Bamford</surname><given-names>DH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Replicase activity of purified recombinant protein P2 of double-stranded RNA bacteriophage &#x003d5;6</article-title><source>EMBO J.</source><year>2000</year><volume>19</volume><fpage>124</fpage><lpage>133</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10619851</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B10"><label>10</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Laurila</surname><given-names>MR</given-names></name><name><surname>Salgado</surname><given-names>PS</given-names></name><name><surname>Stuart</surname><given-names>DI</given-names></name><name><surname>Grimes</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Bamford</surname><given-names>DH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Back-priming mode of &#x003d5;6 RNA-dependent RNA polymerase</article-title><source>J. Gen. Virol.</source><year>2005</year><volume>86</volume><fpage>521</fpage><lpage>526</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15659773</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B11"><label>11</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Yang</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Makeyev</surname><given-names>EV</given-names></name><name><surname>Bamford</surname><given-names>DH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Comparison of polymerase subunits from